{"seq":3,"slug":"structuring-and-delivering-context","title":"Structuring And Delivering Context","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"layered-and-scoped-context","title":"分层与就近作用域","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/layered-and-scoped-context","wordCount":1723,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"managing-the-context-window","title":"管理上下文窗口","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/managing-the-context-window","wordCount":1500,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"retrieval-and-just-in-time-context","title":"检索与按需上下文","url":"/h/ai-native-engineering/context-engineering-for-codebases/structuring-and-delivering-context/retrieval-and-just-in-time-context","wordCount":1630,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章讲如何组织和投放上下文,让对的知识在对的时刻到位:分层与就近作用域——全局放根、模块特定放模块旁,让 agent 在工作处就读到相关上下文;管理有限的上下文窗口——上下文是稀缺预算,要权衡放什么、不放什么,避免噪音稀释信号;以及检索与按需(just-in-time)上下文——不必一次塞满,而是让 agent 在需要时按需取用相关片段。\n"}